  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Budget Partnership (IBP) Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Taxation in Africa for Transparency and Equity (STATE)

The project aims at Tax system are more responsive to civic actors&#x2019; priorities (impact)
Outcome 1) Civic coalitions have improved collective capacities to engage in effective tax advocacy
Outcome 2) Tax systems provide meaningful spaces for increased civic participation
Outcome 3) Global and regional tax processes are informed by stronger civic engagement and relevant evidence</narrative>
  </description>
